post-it: Windows starts and turns off
cause: Faulty CPU fan
symptoms:
	Restarts by itself
	Slow computer
	Can't open pictures
	Programs won't start
	Icons don't open
checks:
	yes: Windows starts
	yes: Memory test passes
	no: Windows stays up after the desktop appears
	no: Bluescreen after the desktop appears
	yes: Freezes with a buzz after the desktop appears
		shows: a second after the desktop appears, the sound sags into a buzz, then a reboot
	no: CPU fan is clean and spins freely
		shows: in the Workview: dust in it, or something lying on it
	yes: Every part sits in its own place
hardware steps:
	Open case
	Clear the CPU fan
	Replace it if it is dirty or broken
	Close case
